__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
runs/
*.db
*.sqlite

# Operational handover material stays local. It names live processes, pids, panes, a
# schedule and this machine, and the repository is public: see docs/PUBLIC-SAFETY.md
# and tools/public_safety.py, which enforces the same list in content and in names.
NIGHT-*
night-snapshot-*/
night-snapshot-*
snapshot-*/

# The morning page is written for the operator and dated for the day it was written: it
# restates the state of the machine at that hour and is stale by the next one. It stays
# on disk as a working document and off the repo, because it is a snapshot of the run,
# not research.
docs/morning.html

# Credentials and key material never belong in a public repository.
.env
*.env
*.pem
*.key
*_deploy_*
id_rsa*
id_dsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*

# Scratch space: work in progress, patches and logs that are not evidence.
tmp/
scratch/
